            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8.3(b)(7)f The Workforce Skill Team Strategist, the Labor Relations Representative, and the Union Representative will resolve the appeal by majority decision at the meeting or within five (5) workdays thereafter. In the event the Union considers the decision to be inappropriate to the facts of the case, the Union may advance its appeal to the Site Workforce Manager. After this review of the matter by the Site Workforce Manager, unresolved appeals may be advanced.",
